<article class="env-lemma" id="06IE">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/06IE">Lemma <span data-tag="06IE">90.11.15</span>.</a> Let $F: \mathcal{C} \to \textit{Sets}$ be a functor satisfying the hypotheses of Lemma <a href="/tag/06IA" data-tag="06IA">90.11.8</a>. Assume $R = K$ is a field. Then $F(K[V]) \cong TF \otimes _ K V$ for any finite dimensional $K$-vector space $V$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/06I8" data-tag="06I8">90.11.6</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>